---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Get started with TwineLine"
  description="Choose your setup and get step-by-step instructions to start using TwineLine."
>
  <div
    class="content-pane mx-auto max-w-4xl mt-6 sm:mt-10 mb-12 sm:mb-20 px-6 sm:px-10 py-8 sm:py-12"
  >
    <!-- Orientation -->
    <section class="pb-4 sm:pb-6">
      <h1
        class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight"
        style="color: var(--text-primary);"
      >
        Setting up TwineLine
      </h1>
      <p
        class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed"
        style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
      >
        TwineLine has three parts: your <strong
          style="color: var(--text-primary);">photo libraries</strong
        >, a <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">server</strong> that builds
        your slideshows, and <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          >displays</strong
        > that show them. Any web browser works as a display &mdash; we also offer
        a lightweight app for Google TV and Fire TV that provides a cleaner, full-screen
        experience.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Architecture diagram -->
    <section class="py-6 sm:py-8">
      <!-- Main flow: Photos → Server → TV -->
      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-stretch gap-2 sm:gap-0"
      >
        <!-- Your Photos -->
        <div
          class="glass p-4 sm:p-5 text-center flex-1 w-full sm:w-auto min-w-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
            style="background: var(--accent-glow);"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              style="color: var(--accent);"
            >
              <path
                d="M6.5 19h11a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1.09-8.87 6 6 0 0 0-11.18 0A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 6.5 19z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4
            class="text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5"
            style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          >
            Your photos
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            OneDrive or local files
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Arrow -->
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-center px-2 sm:px-4 py-1 sm:py-0"
          style="color: var(--accent);"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 hidden sm:block"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 sm:hidden"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M12 5v14M5 13l7 7 7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- TwineLine Server -->
        <div
          class="glass p-4 sm:p-5 text-center flex-1 w-full sm:w-auto min-w-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center"
          style="border-color: var(--accent); border-width: 1px;"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
            style="background: var(--accent-glow);"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              style="color: var(--accent);"
            >
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="8" rx="2"></rect>
              <rect x="3" y="13" width="18" height="8" rx="2"></rect>
              <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
              <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4
            class="text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5"
            style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          >
            TwineLine server
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            Your computer or cloud
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Arrow with WiFi label -->
        <div
          class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-2 sm:px-4 py-1 sm:py-0"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5"
            style="color: var(--text-muted);">WiFi</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 hidden sm:block"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            style="color: var(--accent);"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 sm:hidden"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            style="color: var(--accent);"
          >
            <path d="M12 5v14M5 13l7 7 7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Your TV -->
        <div
          class="glass p-4 sm:p-5 text-center flex-1 w-full sm:w-auto min-w-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
            style="background: var(--accent-glow);"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              style="color: var(--accent);"
            >
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4
            class="text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5"
            style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          >
            Your TV
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            Smart TV, stick, or computer
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phone/remote control -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center mt-3">
        <div class="h-4 w-px" style="background: var(--glass-border);"></div>
        <div class="glass px-4 py-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            style="color: var(--accent);"
          >
            <rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2"></rect>
            <path d="M10 18h4"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);"
            >Control from your phone or TV remote</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-sm mt-6 mx-auto max-w-md text-center"
        style="color: var(--text-muted);"
      >
        Want a deeper look? <a
          href="/how-it-works"
          class="underline"
          style="color: var(--accent);">Learn how it works</a
        > for detailed comparisons and diagrams.
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed"
        style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
      >
        There are two ways to run the server:
      </p>
      <ul
        class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-base leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5"
        style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
      >
        <li>
          <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Your computer</strong> &mdash;
          free forever, runs when your computer is on
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Cloud hosting</strong> &mdash;
          about $7/month, always on, accessible from anywhere
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p
        class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed"
        style="color: var(--text-muted);"
      >
        We recommend starting with cloud &mdash; the first two months are free,
        and you can switch to your own computer anytime.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="/setup" class="btn-accent inline-block"> Choose your setup </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
